<!-- ════════════════ 07 · PROJECTEN · PLAN VAN AANPAK ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Projecten · aanpak" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #06b6d4;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/><line x1="10" y1="20" x2="14" y2="4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">07</span>Spoor 2 · Projecten · plan van aanpak</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Van vraag tot <span class="accent">werkende software</span> in 5 stappen.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
        <div class="steps steps-row" style="margin-top: 36px;">
          <div class="step" style="--c:#06b6d4">
            <div class="step-head">
              <span class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5"/></svg></span>
              <span class="big-n">01</span>
            </div>
            <h4>Intake</h4>
            <p>Proces, systemen en doel scherpstellen. Waar zit de <strong>grootste hefboom</strong>?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step" style="--c:#06b6d4">
            <div class="step-head">
              <span class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21h6"/><path d="M14.5 4.5a2.12 2.12 0 1 1 3 3L8 17l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z"/></svg></span>
              <span class="big-n">02</span>
            </div>
            <h4>POC-scope</h4>
            <p>Afbakening, <strong>succescriteria</strong> en acceptatie vooraf vastgelegd met je eigen mensen.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step" style="--c:#06b6d4">
            <div class="step-head">
              <span class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/><line x1="10" y1="20" x2="14" y2="4"/></svg></span>
              <span class="big-n">03</span>
            </div>
            <h4>Bouwen</h4>
            <p>In <strong>korte cycli</strong>, met een eerste werkende versie als ijkpunt in plaats van een demo.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step" style="--c:#06b6d4">
            <div class="step-head">
              <span class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></span>
              <span class="big-n">04</span>
            </div>
            <h4>Oplevering</h4>
            <p>Repo's, CI/CD, documentatie en runbook horen <strong>bij de oplevering</strong>, niet erna.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step" style="--c:#06b6d4">
            <div class="step-head">
              <span class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="14"/></svg></span>
              <span class="big-n">05</span>
            </div>
            <h4>Opschalen</h4>
            <p>Evalueren en <strong>uitbreiden</strong> naar een volgende piste, of overdragen aan je eigen team.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gov-strip">
          <span class="gov-lead">Alles binnen <strong>je bestaande kaders</strong>:</span>
          <span class="gov-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <span>Data binnen je perimeter</span>
          </span>
          <span class="gov-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v6m0 6v6m11-7h-6m-6 0H1"/></svg>
            <span>Human-in-the-loop</span>
          </span>
          <span class="gov-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M9 15l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            <span>Auditeerbaar en traceerbaar</span>
          </span>
          <span class="gov-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
            <span>Model- en toolgovernance</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "07" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "09" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
